    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_01",
      "hash64": "3628B9A5496FE732",
      "text": "Gyah! What—? [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_02",
      "hash64": "3628B8A5496FE57F",
      "text": "Hurry up and hide! And keep quiet, OK?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_03",
      "hash64": "3628B7A5496FE3CC",
      "text": "Phew... That was close.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_select_01",
      "hash64": "20DD942EF5E4E181",
      "text": "Whatcha doing?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_select_02",
      "hash64": "20DD912EF5E4DC68",
      "text": "Something up?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_04",
      "hash64": "3628B6A5496FE219",
      "text": "Um... Yeah, you know, I’m just... Errr...\\c\\n*sigh*\\nGuess I might as well come clean.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_05",
      "hash64": "3628B5A5496FE066",
      "text": "Take a look over there.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_06",
      "hash64": "3628B4A5496FDEB3",
      "text": "Do you get it now?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_select_03",
      "hash64": "20DD922EF5E4DE1B",
      "text": "...Not really?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_select_04",
      "hash64": "20DD972EF5E4E69A",
      "text": "A little context, please?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_07",
      "hash64": "3628B3A5496FDD00",
      "text": "Ah. Sorry. Your jump scare earlier completely\\nfrazzled me. My brain’s still trying to reboot.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_08",
      "hash64": "3628C2A5496FF67D",
      "text": "All right, here’s the sitch. Team Star’ve started\\ncoming to school again...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_09",
      "hash64": "3628C1A5496FF4CA",
      "text": "But I don’t know if they’re gonna fit in OK, and\\nit’s been playing on my mind, you know?\\r\\nSo I’m checking on them from over here...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_01",
      "hash64": "65304FA143DF53AA",
      "text": "Hmph... Guess we’re still not exactly gettin’ a\\nwarm welcome here, huh?[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_01",
      "hash64": "1D3B2C79154455C0",
      "text": "Well, duh.[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_02",
      "hash64": "1D3B2F7915445AD9",
      "text": "Sure, the teachers finally figured out we’re not a\\nbunch of delinquents...[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_03",
      "hash64": "1D3B2E7915445926",
      "text": "But it’s not like we can press some magic button\\nto make everyone else accept us.[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_02",
      "hash64": "65304EA143DF51F7",
      "text": "True story. We gotta fix this, my man. Time for a\\nchange of tack![VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_10",
      "hash64": "3625B4A5496DA8DC",
      "text": "Huh? A change of tack...?\\c\\nWhat, are they gonna start wearing normal school\\nuniforms so they stop scaring off the other kids?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_11",
      "hash64": "3625B5A5496DAA8F",
      "text": "Oh, Momo... Ortie... They’re both really trying\\ntheir best to fit in here at school...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_04",
      "hash64": "1D3B317915445E3F",
      "text": "A “change of tack,” huh? What exactly are\\nyou suggesting?[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_03",
      "hash64": "65304DA143DF5044",
      "text": "Buh? I mean, uhhh...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_04",
      "hash64": "65304CA143DF4E91",
      "text": "How ’bout we say a big, friendly howdy to\\neveryone here? Like, just yell it. Loud as we can.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_05",
      "hash64": "1D3B307915445C8C",
      "text": "WHAT?! That’s stupid! Go on and embarrass\\nyourself if you want to, but count me out![VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_12",
      "hash64": "3625B6A5496DAC42",
      "text": "Errr. Yeah, that idea seems a bit...off.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_05",
      "hash64": "65304BA143DF4CDE",
      "text": "Hold up—lemme explain.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_06",
      "hash64": "65304AA143DF4B2B",
      "text": "You know Ryme, right? She does this at her\\nconcerts, no joke.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_07",
      "hash64": "653049A143DF4978",
      "text": "If the crowd ain’t hyped at the start of the show,\\nshe’ll shout the loudest greetin’ you ever heard\\r\\ninto the mike. Like “S’UP Y’ALL” or whatever!\\c\\nLifts the mood like nobody’s business.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 148,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 190,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_06",
      "hash64": "1D3B3379154461A5",
      "text": "Yeah, that makes sense. ’Cause those are\\nCONCERTS. This is SCHOOL. It’s different.[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_08",
      "hash64": "653048A143DF47C5",
      "text": "OK, smart guy. So we’re optin’ for the cold\\nshoulder treatment forever, then, are we?[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_07",
      "hash64": "1D3B327915445FF2",
      "text": "N-no... That’d totally suck.[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_09",
      "hash64": "653047A143DF4612",
      "text": "It would, wouldn’t it? So yeah. Our only option is\\nto yell at everyone so they know we’re nice.\\r\\nHere, I’m gonna go for it...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_10",
      "hash64": "652CCAA143DC3BD4",
      "text": "HEEEY!!! MORNIN’, Y’AAAAAALL!!!\\nHOW WE ALL FEELIN’ TODAAAY??!![VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_08",
      "hash64": "1D3B35791544650B",
      "text": "Oh nooo! Giacomo! What are you DOING?!\\nThis is SO embarrassing![VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_11",
      "hash64": "652CCBA143DC3D87",
      "text": "EVERYONE HAVIN’ A GOOD TIIIIIIME??!!\\nC’mon, Ortega—you gotta do it, too![VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_fairy_09",
      "hash64": "1D3B347915446358",
      "text": "Hold on a sec! You...you’re just practicing for\\nyour DJ sets, aren’t you?[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_a_aku_12",
      "hash64": "652CCCA143DC3F3A",
      "text": "THANKS FOR COMIN’ TONIGHT!!!\\nQuick! Say it![VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
